          "raw": "//敌人是否在攻击范围内\n\nif(parent.$fighter_ctrler.targetInRange([0,1000])){\n\t//瞬间移动[参数：X,Y,是否自动转向]\n\tparent.$fighter_ctrler.moveToTarget(-80,null,false);\n}else{\n\tparent.$fighter_ctrler.moveOnce(150,0);\n}\n\n\nparent.$mc_ctrler.movePercent(1,0);\nparent.$mc_ctrler.dampingPercent(0.05,0);"
